1
00:00:00,865 --> 00:00:03,135
(Leonard:)It really does hold up.

2
00:00:05,536 --> 00:00:07,606
(dance music blaring,
women whooping and cheering)

3
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:15,540
(Bernadette:)See? Isn't this better
than a hotel room?

4
00:00:15,546 --> 00:00:18,616
Yep. Shake that thing!

5
00:00:18,616 --> 00:00:22,856
(Bernadette:)Have you ever seen a body
so fine?

6
00:00:22,854 --> 00:00:25,524
(Amy:)We had some pretty hot corpses
in my anatomy class,

7
00:00:25,523 --> 00:00:27,893
(Amy:)but none of them
moved like that!

8
00:00:38,536 --> 00:00:41,306
PENNY:
Good morning.

9
00:00:41,305 --> 00:00:42,905
(Penny:)You want to go
to the pool?

10
00:00:42,907 --> 00:00:45,307
(both groaning)

11
00:00:45,309 --> 00:00:48,379
(Amy:)Come on...
you said it yourself.

12
00:00:48,379 --> 00:00:51,209
(Penny:)Only nerds and losers
stay in the room.

13
00:00:51,215 --> 00:00:54,455
Oh! Oh!
Oh!

14
00:00:54,452 --> 00:00:56,222
(Penny:)Wow, it's bright out.

15
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,820
(Penny:)Isn't it bright? I should
probably close these curtains.

16
00:00:58,823 --> 00:01:00,293
Nah. Bye!

17
00:01:02,026 --> 00:01:04,356
(Bernadette:)Would you please close
the drapes?

18
00:01:04,362 --> 00:01:06,022
(Leonard:)Okay.

